{"seq":2,"slug":"hit-detection","title":"命中检测与碰撞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/mechanics/hit-detection","wordCount":1522,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"命中检测与碰撞\">命中检测与碰撞</h1><p>拖拽物在屏幕上飞，界面必须每帧回答一个问题：它现在压在哪个放置目标上？这就是命中检测（hit detection / collision detection）。听起来只是&quot;两个矩形有没有交集&quot;，可一旦放置目标有几十上百个、又要求每帧算完不掉帧，算法的选择和几何的细节就成了拖放流畅与否的分水岭。这一篇讲清楚几种碰撞算法的数学、各自的适用场景，以及不把浏览器拖垮的工程手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-命中检测的三层问题\">核心概念：命中检测的三层问题</h2><p>&quot;拖拽物压在谁身上&quot;这个问题有三层，本篇由表及里：<strong>选算法</strong>（矩形相交、指针包含、最近中心、最近角，各对应不同交互语义，可访问性还会反过来约束选择）、<strong>算几何</strong>（相交是两轴投影都重叠，最近距离用平方距离避免开方）、以及<strong>保性能</strong>（瓶颈不在算术而在 <code>getBoundingClientRect</code> 引发的布局抖动，靠 rect 缓存与按需失效解决）。三层都处理好，几十上百个目标每帧遍历也不掉帧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"碰撞的四种主流算法\">碰撞的四种主流算法</h2><p>给定拖拽物的矩形与一组放置目标矩形，&quot;命中谁&quot;没有唯一正解——取决于交互语义。dnd-kit 内置四种算法，覆盖了绝大多数需求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>判定依据</th>\n<th>最适合</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>矩形相交 rectIntersection</td>\n<td>两矩形重叠面积 &gt; 0</td>\n<td>大目标、自由放置</td>\n<td>目标密集时可能同时命中多个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指针包含 pointerWithin</td>\n<td>指针坐标落在目标矩形内</td>\n<td>精确放置、看板列</td>\n<td>仅限指针传感器，键盘不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最近中心 closestCenter</td>\n<td>拖拽物中心到各目标中心距离最小</td>\n<td>列表排序</td>\n<td>目标大小悬殊时偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最近角 closestCorners</td>\n<td>拖拽物四角到目标四角距离最小</td>\n<td>高度不一的排序</td>\n<td>计算量略大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>pointerWithin</code> 因为只认指针坐标、不认拖拽物矩形，判定最直觉、最不会误命中，但它有一条硬约束——<strong>只对指针传感器有效</strong>，键盘拖拽没有指针坐标，会完全失灵（来源：dnd-kit 碰撞检测文档，2026）。所以官方建议用算法组合：指针在场时用 <code>pointerWithin</code>，回退到 <code>closestCenter</code> 给键盘用。这个&quot;可访问性反过来约束算法选择&quot;的细节，正是<a href=\"../practice/dnd-accessibility\">《键盘与无障碍拖放》</a>要展开的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数学-相交判定与最近距离\">数学：相交判定与最近距离</h2><p>两个轴对齐矩形 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 相交，等价于它们在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 两个轴上的投影都重叠。用左上/右下坐标表达，相交条件是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>left</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>right</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>right</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>left</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>top</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>bottom</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>bottom</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>top</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{left}} &lt; B_{\\text{right}} \\ \\wedge\\ A_{\\text{right}} &gt; B_{\\text{left}} \\ \\wedge\\ A_{\\text{top}} &lt; B_{\\text{bottom}} \\ \\wedge\\ A_{\\text{bottom}} &gt; B_{\\text{top}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">left</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">right</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">right</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">left</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">top</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bottom</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bottom</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">top</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要有一个不等式不成立，两矩形必不相交——这也是短路优化的依据。<code>closestCenter</code> 则是求拖拽物中心 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(c_x, c_y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 到目标中心 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t_x, t_y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的距离，取最小者。实际实现常用<strong>平方距离</strong>避免开方（比较大小时开方多余）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^2 = (c_x - t_x)^2 + (c_y - t_y)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1502em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>省掉每目标一次 <code>sqrt</code>，在几十上百个目标每帧遍历时，累积节省相当可观。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[每帧: 拿到拖拽物 rect] --&gt; B{有指针坐标?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[pointerWithin: 指针落在哪个目标内]&#10;  B --&gt;|否 键盘| D[closestCenter: 平方距离最小]&#10;  C --&gt; E{命中?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| D&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[得到 overId]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[对比上一帧 overId, 变化才更新视觉]\">flowchart TD\n  A[每帧: 拿到拖拽物 rect] --&gt; B{有指针坐标?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[pointerWithin: 指针落在哪个目标内]\n  B --&gt;|否 键盘| D[closestCenter: 平方距离最小]\n  C --&gt; E{命中?}\n  E --&gt;|否| D\n  E --&gt;|是| F[得到 overId]\n  D --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[对比上一帧 overId, 变化才更新视觉]</pre><h2 id=\"性能-rect-缓存与布局抖动\">性能：rect 缓存与布局抖动</h2><p>命中检测的性能杀手不是算法本身（矩形比较是纯算术、极快），而是<strong>获取矩形</strong>这一步。<code>getBoundingClientRect()</code> 会强制浏览器把尚未提交的样式变更同步计算出来（强制同步布局，forced reflow）。如果在 <code>pointermove</code> 里对每个目标都调一次，就会触发经典的&quot;布局抖动&quot;（layout thrashing）——读、写、读、写交替，浏览器被迫反复重排。</p>\n<p>正确姿势是<strong>批量快照 + 缓存</strong>：拖拽开始时一次性读出所有 droppable 的 rect，存成数组，拖拽过程中直接用缓存值算碰撞，绝不在移动回调里重新测量。代价是缓存会过期——目标位置变了（尤其是自动滚动时、或排序动画让其它项移位时）缓存就不准。应对策略是在这些确切的时机（滚动、布局变化）主动失效并重建缓存，而不是每帧盲目重测。自动滚动导致的坐标漂移见<a href=\"../behaviors/auto-scroll\">《边缘自动滚动》</a>。</p>\n<p>另一个复杂度问题：目标数达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 时，朴素遍历是每帧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。对看板、编辑器这类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 只有几十的场景完全够用；但拖放叠加虚拟列表、目标上千时，就要考虑空间索引（网格分桶、只测视口内目标）把每帧比较降到近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。虚拟化下&quot;目标根本没渲染&quot;的问题见<a href=\"../../frontend-virtual-scrolling/windowing/viewport-window\">《视口与窗口》</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从命中到反馈-只在变化时更新\">从命中到反馈：只在变化时更新</h2><p>命中检测每帧都跑，但视觉不该每帧都改。真正驱动界面的是 <code>overId</code> 的<strong>变化</strong>：这一帧命中的目标和上一帧不同，才需要切换高亮、移动插入线。把&quot;计算命中&quot;和&quot;响应命中变化&quot;分开，能避免每帧无谓的 DOM 写入。命中结果 <code>overId</code> 交给下一环——放置区如何据此渲染高亮与插入指示，是<a href=\"drop-zones\">《放置区与插入指示》</a>的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>命中检测无唯一正解，取决于语义：自由放置用矩形相交，精确放置用指针包含，排序用最近中心/最近角。</li>\n<li><code>pointerWithin</code> 最直觉但只对指针有效，键盘拖拽需组合回退到 <code>closestCenter</code>，可访问性反过来约束算法选择。</li>\n<li>相交判定是两轴投影都重叠；最近距离用平方距离避免开方，几十上百目标每帧遍历时节省明显。</li>\n<li>性能瓶颈在 <code>getBoundingClientRect</code> 引发的布局抖动，解法是拖拽开始时批量快照 rect，按滚动/布局变化的确切时机失效重建。</li>\n<li>视觉只在 <code>overId</code> 变化时更新，把命中计算与命中响应分离。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"pointer-based-dnd\">《基于指针事件的拖放》</a> —— 命中检测挂在它的 rAF 循环里跑。</li>\n<li>下一篇：<a href=\"drop-zones\">《放置区与插入指示》</a> —— 把命中结果画成用户看得懂的反馈。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../frontend-virtual-scrolling/windowing/viewport-window\">《视口与窗口》</a> —— 虚拟化下目标未渲染的应对。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"命中检测与碰撞","id":"命中检测与碰撞"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：命中检测的三层问题","id":"核心概念-命中检测的三层问题"},{"level":2,"text":"碰撞的四种主流算法","id":"碰撞的四种主流算法"},{"level":2,"text":"数学：相交判定与最近距离","id":"数学-相交判定与最近距离"},{"level":2,"text":"性能：rect 缓存与布局抖动","id":"性能-rect-缓存与布局抖动"},{"level":2,"text":"从命中到反馈：只在变化时更新","id":"从命中到反馈-只在变化时更新"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"基于指针事件的拖放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/mechanics/pointer-based-dnd"},"next":{"title":"放置区与插入指示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/mechanics/drop-zones"}}